      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is not wrong to want the weight to stop; it is a completely natural reaction to an unbearable amount of pain. The struggle you feel is the sheer exhaustion of carrying a life that has suddenly been stripped of its foundation. If the weight is too much, the most immediate and honest thing you can do is seek the absolute quiet of a real, immediate pause. Please, let yourself reach out to someone right now—a helpline, a friend, anyone—because you deserve to have someone witness this unbearable heaviness with you.",
